Puran's headman asked the party to find raiders who had taken villagers. In a cave, the group faced a captured cave troll and fought as a team for the first time.
They found the missing survivors and learned the raiders were deserters, driven to violence by hunger and madness.
Moka: We brought them home. That is what matters now.
